/dist/

# Compiled binary from `go build .` in the repo root. `make build` installs
# to $(go env GOPATH)/bin instead, so nothing here needs to be tracked.
/crush
/chore-crusher

# Local SQLite data created by `make dev` / manual runs against a scratch
# database. The real data file lives under $XDG_DATA_HOME, never here.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Screenshots and demo recordings staged for README/docs but not yet committed.
/demo/*.gif
/demo/*.png
chore-crusher

# Agent-drafting artefacts. Plans are working documents for whoever (or
# whatever) is implementing a change; they are not product documentation and
# they go stale in ways the code does not. The surviving content lives in
# docs/DESIGN.md and docs/ROADMAP.md. The originals are kept outside the repo,
# at ~/Documents/projects/plans/chore-crusher/.
/docs/plan/
/docs/plans/
/MCP_COMFORT_PLAN.md

# Local tooling state, machine-specific and not part of the project.
/.token-optimizer/
/.pi/
/.claude/
